OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Flate sunshine, then a dry evening and
OL,7,Fovernight period with often clear
OL,8,Fskies. Possibly turning cloudier in
OL,9,Fthe west by dawn. A much cooler night
OL,10,Fand becoming rather chilly in the
OL,11,Fcountryside by the morning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FEastern areas of Wales will be
OL,14,Fsunniest on Monday with western areas
OL,15,Foften much cloudier. Here the cloud
OL,16,Fcould give the odd drizzly outbreak,
OL,17,Fmainly in the northwest. Feeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
