OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FSimilar on Tuesday with a mixture of
OL,7,Fcloud and some sunshine. Turning
OL,8,Fbreezier and cooler on Wednesday with
OL,9,Fshowers, perhaps heavy, especially
OL,10,Ffurther north. Dry with sunny spells
OL,11,Fon Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
